const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文研究交易商库存、报价修订与订单失衡所传递信息之间的动态关系。 阅读时先把它理解为一个被界定的问题，而不是可以脱离样本、时间和制度环境的结论。",en:"The paper examines dynamic links among dealer inventories, quote revisions, and information conveyed by order imbalance. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.1993.tb05122.x",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (1993) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (1993) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"来源以包含库存与信息效应的动态做市模型为起点，并用纽约证券交易所一名 specialist 的库存资料检验。 这说明比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系是研究合同的一部分；改变其中任何一项，都可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It starts from a dynamic market-making model with inventory and information effects, then tests it with inventory records for one NYSE specialist. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.1993.tb05122.x",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (1993) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (1993) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"关键输入包括交易商库存、交易、报价修订、订单失衡代理及它们一致的日内时间戳。 数据字段、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原始研究分开记录，不能仅凭同名变量或最终修订数据就视为可比。",en:"Key inputs are dealer inventory, trades, quote revisions, order-imbalance proxies, and mutually consistent intraday timestamps. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.1993.tb05122.x",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (1993) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (1993) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"摘要讨论库存向目标水平回归，以及报价修订与交易和订单失衡信息之间的关系，并非所有电子市场的通用描述。 它支持的是该来源所描述的经验或理论关系；它本身不把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"The abstract discusses inventory movement toward a target and quote revisions related to trade and imbalance information, not a universal description of electronic markets. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not convert association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.1993.tb05122.x",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (1993) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (1993) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"记录交易商角色和制度、库存数据可见范围、报价更新顺序及交易方向识别规则，避免把库存代理当作真实账户头寸。 在做后续分析前，应把这些选择写入版本化的研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Record the dealer role and institution, inventory visibility, quote-update ordering, and trade-direction rule; do not treat a proxy as an actual account position. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.1993.tb05122.x",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (1993) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (1993) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 The Journal of Finance (1993)。特定 specialist 制度和单一库存样本不能替代现代订单簿、参与者身份或其他市场的做市行为证据。 若需要量化结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites The Journal of Finance (1993). A specialist regime and one inventory sample cannot substitute for modern order books, participant identity, or market-making evidence elsewhere. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.1993.tb05122.x",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (1993) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (1993) · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“An Analysis of Changes in Specialist Inventories and Quotations”所公开说明的研究问题与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。特定 specialist 制度和单一库存样本不能替代现代订单簿、参与者身份或其他市场的做市行为证据。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “An Analysis of Changes in Specialist Inventories and Quotations”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
